# Security

## Always
- Secrets via env (`config` package), never hardcoded
- Hash passwords (bcrypt), hash OTP at rest
- Validate JWT + check `revoked_tokens`
- Parameterized GORM queries only

## Scans
- Light (every edit): `make ai-security-light` — go vet, gosec
- Heavy (before done): `make ai-security-heavy` — semgrep + gitleaks

Never bypass failing security checks.
